      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What is the speech-to-text provider you're suggesting? It's non-trivial to run Whisper v3 medium locally on minimum spec hardware supported by VRChat, and the online speech-to-text providers aren't generally free or may be rate-limited.\n\nThis is really a domain for SteamVR tools with general usefulness imo, not VRChat specifically. OVR Toolkit has some kind of speech-to-text keyboard functionality using a free Google API, but it's obviously limited in selection of providers to only that one.",
